IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MOE-OFFLOAD.

DATA DIVISION.
01 GPU-EXPERTS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 HOST-EXPERTS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 NVME-EXPERTS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-MOE-OFFLOAD.
    IF GPU-EXPERTS == 0 AND HOST-EXPERTS == 0 AND NVME-EXPERTS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 16400 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 GPU-EXPERTS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
